<title>DUBAI: Emirates starts flights to Kuala Lumpur via Dhaka.</title>
<headline>Emirates starts flights to Kuala Lumpur via Dhaka.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Government-owned Emirates airline said it started on Sunday a thrice-weekly service to Kuala Lumpur via Dhaka on an Airbus A300-600 aircraft.</p>
<p>This brings to 40 the number of destinations Emirates flies to, the airline said in a statement.</p>
</text>
